# Builder dialogue (Rowan Ridgecraft)

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.root.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.root.hc0=Ask about a home
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.root.hc1=Finish the home quest
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.root.hc2=Check on the house quest
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.root.c0=Talk about the builder's hut
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.root.c1=Finish the hut quest
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.root.c2=Check on the hut build
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.root.c3=Ask about building the hut
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.root.c4=Goodbye

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_quest_hut.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_quest_hut.body=I take pride in every wall that goes up in this town. Give me a proper builder's hut with a bench and plans, and I will help your plots rise faster while I am on the clock.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_quest_hut.c0=Accept the quest
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_quest_hut.c1=Not now

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_accepted.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_accepted.body=Take this plot token. Stake the hut, pay the sign, and let the build run. When the roof is on, find me at the bench.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_accepted.c0=Understood

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_building.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_building.body=I can already picture the finished hut. Have you staked the plot and started the build yet?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_building.c0=Abandon the quest
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_building.c1=Still working on it

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_abandoned.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_abandoned.body=That is fine. I will wait at the inn until you are ready to try again.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_abandoned.c0=Goodbye

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_done.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_done.body=Now this is a hut worth signing my name on. When other plots are going up, I will be out there with my hammer lending a hand.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_done.c0=Happy to have you here

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_offer.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_offer.body=The hut is for work. I would like a small house of my own when you have time to stake one.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_offer.c0=Accept the quest
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_offer.c1=Not now

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_accepted.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_accepted.body=Take the house token and build a plot. Assign me on the management block when it is ready.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_accepted.c0=Understood

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_remind.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_remind.body=I still need a house assigned to me on the management block.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_remind.c0=I will take care of it

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_finish.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_finish.body=Warm walls and a solid roof. I can rest easy and still keep an eye on the town's builds.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rowan_house_finish.c0=Welcome home

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.gift.love=Perfect. Good timber and clean stone tell me you understand what holds a building up.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.gift.like=Useful stuff. I can always find a place for that on site.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.gift.neutral=Not quite my taste, but thank you anyway.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.gift.dislike=I would rather not keep that around the hut.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.main_hub.fallback=If you need the hut, a house, or help with a plot, say the word.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.main_hub.greeting.0=Good lines on that last roof. I noticed.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.main_hub.greeting.1=I was sketching a floor plan in my head. Old habit.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.main_hub.greeting.2=Every town deserves buildings that stand straight. Yours is getting there.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.main_hub.greeting.3=Sorry about the sawdust. I never leave home without a bit of it.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.main_hub.hint.love.0=Bring me timber, stone, or a proper builder's bench and you will make my day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.main_hub.hint.love.1=A good hammer is always welcome in my hands.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.main_hub.hint.dislike.0=Please do not bring me trash or void junk.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.main_hub.hint.dislike.1=Dead plants and bone piles do not belong on my workbench.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rep_reward_50.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.rep_reward_100.speaker=Rowan Ridgecraft

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.birthday.greeting=Birthday today. I will take a steady foundation and good company.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.gift.love.birthday=It is my birthday and this gift is wonderful. You made my whole day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.gift.like.birthday=A birthday gift like this. You have good taste.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.gift.neutral.birthday=Thanks. A simple gift on my birthday still means a lot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_builder.gift.dislike.birthday=It is my birthday and you brought that. Well. I still appreciate the thought.
